OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Tax rises needed to plug #35bn gap'
OL,4,Aand 'Putin breaks Trump's 'ceasefire"
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Financial Times, the
OL,7,FTrump administration is threatening to
OL,8,Fcut off weapons supplies to Ukraine as
OL,9,Fpart of efforts to stop it attacking
OL,10,FRussian energy infrastructure. European
OL,11,Fofficials have told the paper they
OL,12,Freceived calls from their American
OL,13,Fcounterparts discussing such plans over
OL,14,Fthe weekend. The White House has
OL,15,Fdeclined to comment.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
