OL,3,A'Tax rises needed to plug #35bn gap'
OL,4,Aand 'Putin breaks Trump's 'ceasefire"
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Daily Mail focuses on Boris Johnson
OL,7,Flabelling Trump's agreement with
OL,8,FRussian President Vladimir Putin to
OL,9,Flift sanctions so Russia can supply
OL,10,Fdiesel to US and global markets as
OL,11,F"sickening". The former prime minister
OL,12,Falso says the Royal Navy should
OL,13,Fintercept any Russian fuel ships in the
OL,14,FEnglish Channel.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
