OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Tax rises needed to plug #35bn gap'
OL,4,Aand 'Putin breaks Trump's 'ceasefire"
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guardian reports that ministers are
OL,7,Fpreparing to slash the funds available
OL,8,Fto subsidise heat pumps, as they look
OL,9,Ffor savings to increase defence
OL,10,Fspending. The programme is not expected
OL,11,Fto be abolished, but sources tell the
OL,12,Fpaper that hundreds of millions of
OL,13,Fpounds could be cut from the scheme's
OL,14,F#2.7bn budget. A government
OL,15,Fspokesperson has said details of how
OL,16,Finvestment in the country's national
OL,17,Fsecurity will be set out this autumn.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/4
